  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "AI在化工上之應用",
    "sub_ename": "APPLICATIONS OF AI IN CHEMICAL ENGINEERING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程介紹人工智慧於化工領域中的應用，內容涵蓋機器學習與深度學習之基礎概念，並以 Python、scikit-learn 與 TensorFlow 為主要工具，搭配 Google Colab 進行實作操作。學生將從資料前處理、模型選擇、訓練與驗證等流程，理解 AI 技術如何用於解決化工製程與工程問題。課程以循序漸進方式設計，引領初學者逐步養成建立與應用中高階AI智慧系統之能力。",
    "describe_eh": "This course introduces the application of Artificial Intelligence in chemical engineering. It covers fundamental concepts of machine learning and deep learning, utilizing Python, scikit-learn, and TensorFlow as the primary tools, with hands-on practice via Google Colab. Students will learn the complete workflow—from data preprocessing and model selection to training and validation—gaining insight into how AI techniques can be applied to solve chemical process and engineering problems. The course is designed in a step-by-step manner to help beginners develop the skills in building AI systems.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
