      "describe_ch": "瞭解人工智慧於化工領域中的基本概念與應用原理",
      "describe_en": "Understand the fundamental concepts of artificial intelligence and its application principles in the field of chemical engineering."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "具備利用 AI 分析化工製程問題並提出適當策略之能力",
      "describe_en": "Demonstrate the ability to analyze chemical process problems using AI techniques and propose appropriate strategies."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "在小組專案中能有效協作，進行 AI 模型開發與成果討論",
      "describe_en": "Effectively collaborate in group projects to develop AI models and discuss analytical results."
    },
    {
      "seq": 4,
      "describe_ch": "具備持續學習人工智慧工具與掌握國際智慧製程技術發展的能力",
      "describe_en": "Possess the capability for continuous learning of AI tools and to stay informed about international advancements in intelligent process technologies."
    }
